        rdfs:range xsd:anyURI .

    <https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Build/configSourceDigest> a owl:ObjectProperty ;
        rdfs:comment """Property that describes the digest of the build configuration file used to
invoke a build."""@en ;
